### Uncovering Greatness CRM: manual API requests (Visual Studio 2022 or VS Code "REST Client")
@host = http://localhost:5080
@email = michaela@uncoveringgreatness.co.za
@password = P@ssword4321

### 1. Health (no token)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### 2. Sign in. Copy "accessToken" from the response into @token below
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Who am I?
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My leads
GET {{host}}/api/v1/leads?view=mine&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pipeline
GET {{host}}/api/v1/leads/pipeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a lead
POST {{host}}/api/v1/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Test", "surname": "Lead", "email": "test.lead@example.com", "source": "Website", "stage": "Lead", "dealValue": 10000 }

### Move a lead to another stage (replace 1 with a real id)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/leads/1/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "Qualified" }

### Task board
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calendar for a month
GET {{host}}/api/v1/calendar?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard / search / notifications
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/search?q=summit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications?filter=unread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change my password (new token is returned, the old one stops working)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{password}}", "newPassword": "Choose#AStrongOne2026" }

### Refresh the token
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sign out everywhere
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- Admin only (sign in as admin@uncoveringgreatness.co.za) ----
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/audit?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Force a user to sign in again (replace 2 with a user id)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/2/revoke-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unlock a locked-out user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/2/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
